---
import wing from "../assets/hermes-agent-wing.svg";

const first = "Hermes remembers everything.".split(" ");
const second = "Helmet teaches it to".split(" ");
const rows = [
  ["Starts from a blank slate.", "Ships with a method: clarify, plan, build, review, verify."],
  ["Says it’s done.", "Proves it’s done. A passing check, or it isn’t finished."],
  ["Spawns more agents, spends more tokens.", "Sizes the team to the task and keeps caches warm."],
  ["Prompts tuned for one model family.", "Routes each job to the cheapest model that can do it."],
];
---

<section id="why" class="sec" style="overflow:hidden">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="stmt">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow kicker">Why Helmet</p>
        <h2
          class="h2 h2-xl stmt-h"
          style="margin-top:20px"
          aria-label="Hermes remembers everything. Helmet teaches it to ship."
        >
          <span aria-hidden="true">
            {first.map((w) => (
              <span class="lit">{w} </span>
            ))}
            <br />
            {second.map((w) => (
              <span class="lit soft">{w} </span>
            ))}
            <span class="lit" style="position:relative;display:inline-block">
              ship.
              <span
                class="ln-h ln-sun"
                style="position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:2px;height:5px;border-radius:var(--radius-pill)"
              ></span>
            </span>
          </span>
        </h2>
        <p class="rv lead" style="max-width:600px">
          Hermes Agent is a capable, self-improving agent that starts with nothing. Helmet adds the engineering
          discipline around it, and keeps the memory that makes it good.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="stmt-art">
        <div class="tilt">
          <div class="float">
            <div class="nous-badge">
              <img src={wing.src} width={wing.width} height={wing.height} alt="Hermes Agent logo" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="eyebrow">Built on Hermes Agent by Nous Research</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="vs rv" role="table" aria-label="Hermes on its own compared with Hermes and Helmet">
      <div class="vs-row vs-head" role="row">
        <span role="columnheader">On its own</span>
        <span role="columnheader">With Helmet</span>
      </div>
      {rows.map(([before, after]) => (
        <div class="vs-row" role="row">
          <span role="cell" class="vs-before">
            {before}
          </span>
          <span role="cell" class="vs-after">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="var(--ink)" />
              <path
                d="m6 10.2 2.6 2.6L14 7.4"
                fill="none"
                stroke="#fff"
                stroke-width="1.8"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              />
            </svg>
            {after}
          </span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
